{"script":"wt_c4_04_1_n","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"炼药师约伦德","text":"[show]嗯？你手头的东西可不够？这种时候来找我干什么？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"炼药师约伦德","text":"[show]一共需要2分孢子簇，我在委托里说的很清楚吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"炼药师约伦德","text":"[show]我的时间很宝贵，在找到足够的孢子簇之前，还请不要打扰我。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"笨拙的请求"}